@hostAddress = http://localhost:5032
@accessToken = TOKEN_EMITIDO_POR_EL_LOGIN_DEL_EQUIPO
@currentPassword = Actual123
@newPassword = Nueva1234

### Ajusta accessToken y currentPassword a una sesion y usuario de prueba.
### Con cookie de sesion, sustituye Authorization por Cookie: access_token=<token>.
### Sin sesion: HTTP 401, sin consultar la base de datos.
PUT {{hostAddress}}/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{currentPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### Campo obligatorio: HTTP 400, sin consultar la base de datos.
PUT {{hostAddress}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### Contraseña actual incorrecta: HTTP 400.
PUT {{hostAddress}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Incorrecta123",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### Nueva contraseña demasiado corta: HTTP 400.
PUT {{hostAddress}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{currentPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "Abc1234",
  "confirmPassword": "Abc1234"
}

### Confirmación diferente: HTTP 400.
PUT {{hostAddress}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{currentPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}",
  "confirmPassword": "Otra1234"
}

### Nueva contraseña igual a la actual: HTTP 400.
PUT {{hostAddress}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{currentPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "{{currentPassword}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{currentPassword}}"
}

### Cambio válido: HTTP 200. Ejecutar al final; cambia la contraseña del usuario.
PUT {{hostAddress}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{currentPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### 1. Registrar Cliente Exitosamente (201 Created)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/cliente/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan Perez",
  "correo": "juan.perez@correo.cl",
  "rut": "12345670K",
  "telefono": "+56912345678"
}

### 2. Probar Validación: RUT con formato inválido (puntos o guion) (400 Bad Request)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/cliente/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Maria Soto",
  "correo": "maria.soto@correo.cl",
  "rut": "12.345.678-5",
  "telefono": "+56987654321"
}

### 3. Probar Validación: Campo obligatorio faltante (400 Bad Request)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/cliente/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "",
  "correo": "test@correo.cl",
  "rut": "12345670K",
  "telefono": "+56912345678"
}

### 4. Probar Validación: Correo o RUT duplicado (409 Conflict)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/cliente/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan Perez Duplicado",
  "correo": "juan.perez@correo.cl",
  "rut": "12345670K",
  "telefono": "+56912345678"
}
